  <p class="lead-para">
    <strong>Low marks in graduation close some doors that use cutoffs, but many private roles, skill based jobs, short courses and self-employment routes judge you on skill and proof, so list which routes use cutoffs, pick routes that reward ability and build a small project and a clear story.</strong> The decisions that unlock high income opportunities include choosing a branch early and building a high-income skill portfolio of finished work, because AI can handle routine tasks but cannot take responsibility for your results.
